======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 79 - Content Delivery Architecture
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Clients upload large video files through application server process memory.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   API generates pre-signed S3 upload URL; client uploads directly to object storage.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
